      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 15,
      "values:originalText": "Omit “For the avoidance of doubt, this section does not preclude\nCrimTrac from entering into a memorandum of understanding or other\narrangement, on behalf of the Commonwealth,”, substitute “CrimTrac\nmay, on behalf of the Commonwealth, enter into an arrangement”."
    },
